Third-party components:

- gtnh-factory-flow (https://github.com/Samiracle64/gtnh-factory-flow), MIT License.
  gtnh_solver consumes plan/recipe JSON EXPORTED by gtnh-factory-flow as input. No
  gtnh-factory-flow source code is included or vendored in this repository; only the
  user's exported data files are read at runtime. GTNH recipe/texture data carried in
  those exports remains under its respective owners' licenses.

- GT5-Unofficial (https://github.com/GTNewHorizons/GT5-Unofficial) and StructureLib
  (https://github.com/GTNewHorizons/StructureLib), both LGPL, GTNewHorizons. The
  dataset-extraction tool under tools/gtnh-extractor depends on these as unmodified
  library dependencies (pulled from the GTNH Nexus) to run a headless server and read
  back multiblock structure facts. No GT5-Unofficial or StructureLib source is vendored
  or patched here. Extracted structure facts are committed to this repository; LGPL
  assets (textures) are not vendored and are fetched from the mod jars at build time.
  Specifically, the 3D previewer (src/gtnh_solver/previewer) fetches the pinned
  GT5-Unofficial jar from the GTNH Nexus at preview time, caches it outside the
  repository, extracts the referenced iconset PNGs, and embeds them (as data: URIs) only
  in the generated preview HTML. No PNG is ever committed to this repository.

- GTNH Calculator (https://github.com/ShadowTheAge/gtnh), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025
  ShadowTheAge. src/gtnh_solver/dataset/nesql.py carries, as Python, the table from its
  export/FontCharactersFixer.cs that maps GT:NH's private-use font glyphs to the Unicode
  symbols they are drawn as. No other part of it is included. Its license:

